MODEL
Per item, not per property. Life = 100 / ratePct (40 years at 2.5%, 25 at
4%). Each financial year from completion is walked and charged the annual
rate prorated by days on foot, so first-year and final-year partials need
no special casing. Cumulative is capped at the original amount.

An item without a completion date claims nothing and sets
missingStartDate, and the register reports how many such items exist -
inferring a date would silently create a deduction.

